<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style=""><div style=""><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="750" style="font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr><td style="line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr width="680"><td align="center" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: center; height: 40px; width: 680px;"><div style="height: 10px; line-height: 15px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="height: 10px; line-height: 15px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); width: 680px;"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en.html" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img border="0" src="http://salesnews.qantas.com/imgproxy/img/2014614867/Announcement_header_680x70.jpg" title="Qantas" style="width: 680px;"></font></a></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="main-content" width="600" style="text-align: center; width: 600px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody><tr><td align="center" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: left;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600"><tbody><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; line-height: 30px; height: 30px;"><font color="#666666" face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;"><font color="#666666" face="Arial, sans-serif">Dear {name},</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font color="#666666" face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" color="#666666">This week, Qantas Valet at Sydney Airport reopened its doors for the first time since March 2020, under the management of Sydney Airport Corporation Limited (SACL).<br><br>The service will remain as Qantas Valet, and the current location and core parking services will stay the same. However, SACL will now manage customer relations, enquiries and feedback on behalf of Qantas Valet.<br><br>Upon arrival to Qantas Valet, customers will be asked to supply their details to staff where they will remain on file. Existing customers will also be required to provide their details as a once off request.<br><br>Express check-in and baggage drop is currently unavailable. Please check-in online before arriving at the airport via the Qantas app or Qantas.com. Once you have exited Valet, please print any required bag tags and drop checked baggage at our self-service bag drop in terminal. For more information on our online check-in process, visit our&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/travel-info/check-in.html" target="_blank" style="border: 0px;">online check-in page</a>&nbsp;or use the Qantas App.<br><br>Qantas Valet customers at Sydney Airport will continue to enjoy:</font><ul style="margin: 5px 0px 0px 40px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 1px;"><li style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; line-height: 20px; margin: 10px 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><font color="#666666" face="Arial, sans-serif">3 Qantas Points per $1 spent</font></li><li style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; line-height: 20px; margin: 10px 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><font color="#666666" face="Arial, sans-serif">Direct terminal access</font></li><li style="font-family: Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; line-height: 20px; margin: 10px 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><font color="#666666" face="Arial, sans-serif">Car cleaning at competitive rates</font></li></ul><font face="Arial, sans-serif" color="#666666"><br>Reservations are not required. Simply drive up and Qantas Valet staff will take care of the rest.<br><br>For more information on Qantas Valet parking at Sydney Airport, including opening hours, parking rates and car cleaning rates, please visit our&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/qantas-experience/at-the-airport/valet-parking/sydney.html?int_cam=au%3Avalet-parking%3Aarticle%3Avalet-parking-available-at-%3Aen%3Ann" target="_blank" style="border: 0px;">website</a>&nbsp;.<br><br>Kind regards,<br><br>AM Name<br><br><em style="">Qantas Airways Limited</em></font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font color="#666666" face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 680px;"><tbody><tr><td align="center" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102)